<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Chill Meme 產生器</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@600;800&family=Nunito:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/html2canvas/1.4.1/html2canvas.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{ --bg:#FFF8E7; --card:#FFFFFF; --primary:#FF7A45; --primary-dark:#E86532; --text:#3D2E2E; --border:#FFE4B5; }
*{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
body{ font-family:'Nunito', sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); min-height:100vh; background-image: radial-gradient(#FFDAB9 2px, transparent 2px); background-size: 22px 22px; }
header{ text-align:center; padding:28px 16px 10px; }
header h1{ font-family:'Baloo 2', cursive; font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px); font-weight:800; }
header p{opacity:.7; margin-top:4px;}
.container{ max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; padding:16px; display:grid; grid-template-columns: 360px 1fr; gap:20px; align-items:start; }
.panel{ background:var(--card); border:3px solid var(--border); border-radius:20px; padding:20px; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px var(--border); position:sticky; top:16px; }
.panel h2{ font-family:'Baloo 2', cursive; font-size:22px; margin-bottom:16px; }
.control-group{ margin-bottom:20px; }
.control-group label{ display:block; font-weight:700; font-size:14px; margin-bottom:8px; }
.hint{ font-size:12px; opacity:.6; margin-top:6px; }
input[type="text"], input[type="file"]{ width:100%; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:12px; border:2px solid var(--border); font-family:'Nunito'; font-size:14px; outline:none; }
input[type="text"]:focus{ border-color: var(--primary); }
input[type="range"]{ width:100%; accent-color: var(--primary); }
.btn{ width:100%; padding:14px; border:none; border-radius:14px; font-family:'Baloo 2', cursive; font-size:18px; font-weight:800; cursor:pointer; transition:.15s; }
.btn-primary{ background:var(--primary); color:white; box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--primary-dark); }
.btn-primary:active{ transform:translateY(3px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--primary-dark); }
.preview-wrap{ background:var(--card); border:3px solid var(--border); border-radius:20px; padding:16px; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px var(--border); }
.preview-title{ font-family:'Baloo 2', cursive; text-align:center; margin-bottom:12px; }
#meme-canvas{ position:relative; width:100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background:#E9E9E9; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
#meme-canvas img{ width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
.meme-text{ position:absolute; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); width:92%; text-align:center; font-family:'Baloo 2', cursive; font-weight:800; color:white; word-break:break-word; line-height:1.15; text-shadow: -3px -3px 0 #000, 3px -3px 0 #000, -3px 3px 0 #000, 3px 3px 0 #000, 0px 4px 0 #000; pointer-events:none; }
#top-text{ top:5%; } #bottom-text{ bottom:5%; }
@media(max-width: 800px){ .container{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .panel{ position:static; } #meme-canvas{ aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><h1>😎 Chill Meme 工廠</h1><p>已套用你的圖片 → 輸入幹話 → 一鍵下載</p></header>
<div class="container">
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>控制台</h2>
    <div class="control-group">
      <label>1. 底圖 (已 dùng link của bạn)</label>
      <input type="file" id="image-input" accept="image/*">
      <div class="hint">Link mặc định: i.postimg.cc/jSYjRQ2H/IMG-4419.jpg
